{
  "id": "toriInboundEmail",
  "name": "Tori 01 · Inbound email",
  "description": "Receives forwarded booking emails (Playo, District) from the inbound email provider (Postmark JSON), stores every email in Postgres, answers 200 and routes it.",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 01 · Inbound email\nOwner Gmail filter → `<venue>-<token>@in.toridesk.com` → Postmark inbound → this webhook.\n\nEvery email is stored first (dedup on provider ID + Message-ID). Then:\n- Playo / District email → **02 Parse + save**\n- Gmail forwarding code → WhatsApp to Ravi (03)\n- anything else → stored, alert, stop",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "553d80bc-1c32-51ee-9c00-41b444f90f0c",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "inbound/postmark",
        "authentication": "basicAuth",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "01b3a3f6-93cd-5a6a-8687-5577c934c997",
      "name": "Postmark inbound",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        -440,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "5b0f3f5e-8d1e-4d7a-9a3c-0b1f2e3d4c01",
      "credentials": {
        "httpBasicAuth": {
          "id": "toriInboundAuth1",
          "name": "Inbound email webhook (basic auth)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "const p = $json.body || {};\nconst headers = {};\nfor (const h of p.Headers || []) {\n  const k = String(h.Name || '').toLowerCase();\n  headers[k] = headers[k] ? `${headers[k]}\\n${h.Value}` : h.Value;\n}\nconst addr = (s) => (String(s || '').match(/[^\\s<>\"',;:]+@[^\\s<>\"',;]+/) || [''])[0].toLowerCase();\nconst htmlToText = (html) => String(html || '')\n  .replace(/<(script|style)[\\s\\S]*?<\\/\\1>/gi, '')\n  .replace(/<br\\s*\\/?>/gi, '\\n')\n  .replace(/<\\/(p|div|tr|li|h\\d|table)>/gi, '\\n')\n  .replace(/<[^>]+>/g, ' ')\n  .replace(/&nbsp;/gi, ' ').replace(/&#8377;|&#x20b9;/gi, '₹')\n  .replace(/&lt;/gi, '<').replace(/&gt;/gi, '>').replace(/&quot;/gi, '\"').replace(/&#39;/gi, \"'\").replace(/&amp;/gi, '&')\n  .replace(/[ \\t]+/g, ' ').replace(/ *\\n */g, '\\n').replace(/\\n{3,}/g, '\\n\\n').trim();\n\nconst sent = new Date(p.Date || headers['date'] || '');\nconst inbound = addr(p.OriginalRecipient || headers['x-forwarded-to'] || (p.ToFull && p.ToFull[0] && p.ToFull[0].Email) || p.To);\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    raw: {\n      provider: 'postmark',\n      provider_message_id: p.MessageID || '',\n      message_id_header: headers['message-id'] || null,\n      inbound_address: inbound,\n      from_address: addr((p.FromFull && p.FromFull.Email) || p.From),\n      from_name: (p.FromFull && p.FromFull.Name) || p.FromName || null,\n      forwarded_for: headers['x-forwarded-for'] || null,\n      subject: p.Subject || '',\n      text_body: p.TextBody || htmlToText(p.HtmlBody),\n      html_body: p.HtmlBody || null,\n      headers,\n      email_date: isNaN(sent) ? null : sent.toISOString(),\n      payload: { ...p, Attachments: (p.Attachments || []).map(({ Content, ...meta }) => meta) },\n    },\n  },\n};\n"
      },
      "id": "d4475f15-b0ee-53a1-9488-d9e419a2443d",
      "name": "Normalize email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
